{{Quote|It would be unfortunate if I had to leave a garrison here.|Darth Vader to Lando Calrissian|<ref name="ESB" />}}
A light<ref name="Helmet Collection 61">{{HelmetCollectionCite|61|Highlights of the Saga}}</ref> '''Imperial Garrison''' was installed on [[Cloud City]] shortly after the [[Battle of Hoth]], following the attempted capture of fleeing members of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]]. [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]], [[Luke Skywalker]], and their newfound ally [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]] along with [[Chewbacca]] and two droids managed to [[Escape from Cloud City|escape]] the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] trap on the heavily modified [[YT-1300 light freighter]] the ''[[Millennium Falcon]]''. Before leaving, [[Baron Administrator]] Lando Calrissian managed to warn the citizens of Cloud City about the recent arrival of Imperial forces, causing many to panic and flee.<ref name="ESB" />

Just after the [[Battle of Endor]], the Imperial Garrison was withdrawn<ref name="Helmet Collection 61" /> in the wake of the [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor's]] death. But [[Governor]] [[Ubrik Adelhard]] reestablished [[Ubrik Adelhard's Imperial remnant|control]] through the [[Iron Blockade]].<ref name="Uprising" />

